  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cd</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>CdO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Primary battery</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mfenced><mi>Hg</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>HgO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>ZnO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Hg</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Discharging of secondary battery</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Pb</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Fuel cell</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Charging of secondary battery</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
